  "segments": [
    {
      "line": 1,
      "text": "1.前往尼维尔海村，托德的家（63.55）二楼（16.15）与流浪乐师托德（9.2）对话，选“是”获得【关于泰司的情报】。",
      "type": "item-acquisition",
      "sourceLines": [
        1
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 2,
      "text": "◆尼维尔海村抵达方式参考《德威特岛》地图，德威特岛各村传送石参考《怀旧服各村落传送石传送条件》",
      "type": "route-reference",
      "sourceLines": [
        2
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 3,
      "text": "2.前往尼维尔海村医院（45.67）与冒险者泰司（39.10）对话，输入“幽绪”交出【关于泰司的情报】、1瓶【生命回复药（400）】，获得【关于幽绪的情报】。",
      "type": "password-exchange",
      "sourceLines": [
        3
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 4,
      "text": "3.返回尼维尔海村托德的家二楼与流浪乐师托德对话，交出【关于幽绪的情报】获得【给幽绪的信】。",
      "type": "exchange-step",
      "sourceLines": [
        4
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 5,
      "text": "4.步行前往德威特岛通往摩顿村的通道（364.548），通过（9.27）处黄色传送石进入利利可洞窟。",
      "type": "maze-entry",
      "sourceLines": [
        5
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 6,
      "text": "◆利利可洞窟为随机迷宫，共13层",
      "type": "maze-detail",
      "sourceLines": [
        6
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 7,
      "text": "迷宫刷新时间：4小时（仅供参考），地图大小范围：40*40~60*60",
      "type": "maze-metadata",
      "sourceLines": [
        7
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 8,
      "text": "宝箱数量：10",
      "type": "treasure-count",
      "sourceLines": [
        8
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 9,
      "text": "魔物为31~35大地鼠、大炸弹、土蜘蛛、火蜘蛛，遇敌数量1~8",
      "type": "encounter-area",
      "sourceLines": [
        9
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 10,
      "text": "5.在迷宫最底层通过黄色传送石到达利利可山洞深处，与天才音乐家幽绪（9.4）对话，交出【给幽绪的信】获得【给托德的信】，并传送回利利可洞窟入口",
      "type": "exchange-teleport",
      "sourceLines": [
        10
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 11,
      "text": "6.步行返回尼维尔，海村托德的家（63.55）二楼（16.15）与流浪乐师托德（9.2）对话，交出【给托德的信】获得【烧鸡订单】、【材料订单】。",
      "type": "combined-acquisition",
      "sourceLines": [
        11
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 12,
      "text": "◆此步可通过【纪念羽毛】飞回法兰城后传送至尼维尔海村",
      "type": "travel-shortcut",
      "sourceLines": [
        12
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 13,
      "text": "7.持有【白金条】1条或【白金】20个、【赤松】20个、【烧鸡】1片与流浪乐师托德对话，交出以上材料、【材料订单】、【烧鸡订单】获得【琴？】。",
      "type": "material-exchange",
      "sourceLines": [
        13
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 14,
      "text": "◆【琴？】鉴定后为【托德制作的琴】；",
      "type": "identification-note",
      "sourceLines": [
        14
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 15,
      "text": "Lv.1，种类：不明；不可交易、可以丢地。",
      "type": "item-detail",
      "sourceLines": [
        15
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 16,
      "text": "持有时与管理称号的NPC对话，获得称号“苦命的小弟”，未持有时与管理称号的NPC对话则失去称号",
      "type": "held-title",
      "sourceLines": [
        16
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 17,
      "text": "8.前往法兰城凯蒂夫人的店（196.78），与凯蒂夫人（17.12）花费30G把【琴？】鉴定为【托德制作的琴】。",
      "type": "identification-step",
      "sourceLines": [
        17
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 18,
      "text": "9.返回利利可洞窟深处，与天才音乐节幽绪对话，交出【托德制作的琴】（注意，不可是未鉴定的【琴？】）获得【永远的第二乐章】。",
      "type": "exchange-step",
      "sourceLines": [
        18
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 19,
      "text": "◆持有【永恒的第二乐章】与幽绪对话会传送回利利可洞窟入口",
      "type": "held-item-teleport",
      "sourceLines": [
        19
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 20,
      "text": "10.前往尼维尔海村托德的家二楼与流浪乐师托德对话，交出【永恒的第二乐章】获得【臂环？】、【耳环？】或【项链？】中的任意一种，任务完结。",
      "type": "completion-exchange",
      "sourceLines": [
        20
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 21,
      "text": "◆【臂环？】鉴定后为【武神的臂环】",
      "type": "identification-note",
      "sourceLines": [
        21
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 22,
      "text": "（4级手环，+15~35攻击，耐久180~250）。",
      "type": "reward-detail",
      "sourceLines": [
        22
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 23,
      "text": "注意：物品不可交易，丢地消失，非鉴定师职业只能在鉴定店里用3840鉴定",
      "type": "item-restriction",
      "sourceLines": [
        23
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 24,
      "text": "◆【耳环？】鉴定后为【天使的守护】",
      "type": "identification-note",
      "sourceLines": [
        24
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
